    "title": "LAPD Officer Killed During Training Exercise - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Contributing Editor ,\n3 hours ago\nA Los Angeles Police Department officer was killed Thursday during an on-duty training exercise. According to the police department, an officer assigned to the Metropolitan Division was killed around 11 a.m. while participating in an on-duty training exercise. No details were released about the nature of the training or where the exercise was held.\nRead full article\nAdd to Preferred Sources",
